# The build context is an allowlist: only what the image needs. Secrets (.env), local state
# (state.db), the virtualenv and caches never reach the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!story_seeds.toml
!src/

# Never, even inside an allowed directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/__pycache__
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/cache
**/.fastf1_cache
**/.DS_Store
